@startuml CU05_Gestionar_Prendas_Variantes
title Diagrama de Comunicación / Robustez ICONIX - CU05: Gestionar Prendas y Variantes de Precio por Talla

top to bottom direction
skinparam actorStyle hollow
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #005522
skinparam ArrowFontColor #000000
skinparam ArrowFontSize 10

actor ":AdministradorTenant" as Act

package "Frontend (Angular PWA)" {
  boundary ":AdminCatalogPageComponent" as Page
  boundary ":CatalogApiService" as Api
}

package "Backend (FastAPI)" {
  control ":CatalogRoutes" as Routes
  control ":CatalogService" as Svc
  
  entity ":Product" as EntProd
  entity ":ProductVariant" as EntVar
  entity ":Category" as EntCat
  entity ":Size" as EntSize
}

' -------------------------------------------------------------
' ENLACES Y MENSAJES DE COMUNICACIÓN
' -------------------------------------------------------------

' 1. Actor <--> Frontend Page
Act --> Page : 1: loadData()\n2: onSubmit()\n3: onSubmit() [SKU duplicado]\n4: onSubmit() [Descuento inválido]

' 2. Frontend Boundaries
Page --> Api : 1.1: listProducts()\n2.1: createProduct()\n3.1: createProduct()\n4.1: createProduct()
Api --> Page : 1.5: setProducts()\n2.8: response() [HTTP 201 Created]
Page --> Act : 3.5: showErrorToast()\n4.3: showErrorToast()

' 3. Frontend <--> Backend Routes
Api --> Routes : 1.2: list_products_route()\n2.2: create_product_route()\n3.2: create_product_route()\n4.2: create_product_route()

Routes --> Api : 3.4: raise_http_exception() [400 SKU Duplicado]\n4.2: raise_http_exception() [400 Descuento Excedido]

' 4. Backend Routes <--> Domain Service
Routes --> Svc : 1.3: query()\n2.3: create_product()

' 5. SELF-LOOP 1 (Validaciones de negocio en CatalogService)
Svc --> Svc : 2.4: validate_variant_payload() [Valida SKU y talla/color únicos]\n2.5: validate_discount() [Valida descuento <= precio]\n3.3: validate_variant_payload() [FAIL: SKU colisiona]\n4.1: validate_discount() [FAIL: Descuento > precio]

' 6. Queries y Persistencia en Entidades
Routes --> EntCat : 1.4: query()
Routes --> EntSize : 1.5: query()

Svc --> EntProd : 1.4: query()\n2.6: create() [Inserta prenda matriz con tenant_id]
Svc --> EntVar : 2.7: create() [Inserta variantes con precio diferenciado por talla]

' 7. SELF-LOOP 2 (Refresco reactivo en Page)
Page --> Page : 2.9: loadData()

@enduml
